Package: lm15
Title: Provider-Neutral Foundation Model Conversations
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R: person("Maxime", "Rivest", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mrive052@gmail.com")
Description: Typed requests, responses, content parts and stream events for
    foundation model conversations. Provider wire formats are translated at
    an explicit boundary, with unsupported requests refused before sending.
    Implements the shared lm15 contract incrementally.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, utils, stats
Suggests: curl, openssl, filelock, later, httpuv, processx, xml2, callr,
    pkgload, testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, tibble, purrr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
SystemRequirements: libcurl (>= 7.86.0) with WebSocket support, pkg-config
Config/testthat/edition: 3
